{"seq":2,"slug":"caching-strategies","title":"缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/caching-strategies","wordCount":1080,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建缓存的基本循环是&quot;计算输入哈希 → 命中则恢复产物，未命中则执行并回填&quot;。围绕这个循环有三个关键概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入哈希（Hash Input）</td>\n<td>所有可能影响任务输出的因素之摘要</td>\n<td>决定缓存正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地缓存</td>\n<td>存在开发者机器上的产物</td>\n<td>同一机器重复构建瞬间完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程缓存</td>\n<td>云端共享的产物</td>\n<td>团队与 CI 复用同一份结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存命中率</td>\n<td>命中次数 / 总次数的比例</td>\n<td>衡量缓存效果的核心指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>缓存的价值在于<strong>把&quot;是否重新构建&quot;由输入是否变化决定</strong>，而非每次都全量执行。它的正确性完全取决于哈希输入定义得是否精确：inputs 过宽会频繁失效，遗漏环境变量或上游产物又会导致错误的缓存命中。因此优化方向始终是&quot;精确输入 + 分离关注点 + 避免非确定性输出&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存是-monorepo-的性能基石\">缓存是 Monorepo 的性能基石</h2><p>在没有缓存的 Monorepo 中，每次执行 <code>turbo run build</code> 都会重新构建所有包——即使大部分包的源码并未改变。<strong>构建缓存</strong>（Build Cache）通过记录每次任务的输入哈希和输出产物，在输入未变时直接复用上次的输出，将构建时间从分钟级降低到秒级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[执行任务] --&gt; HASH[计算输入哈希]&#10;    HASH --&gt; CHECK{缓存中存在&lt;br/&gt;匹配的哈希？}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|命中| RESTORE[恢复缓存的输出]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|未命中| EXECUTE[执行任务]&#10;    EXECUTE --&gt; STORE[将输出存入缓存]&#10;    RESTORE --&gt; DONE[任务完成 ⚡]&#10;    STORE --&gt; DONE\">flowchart TD\n    START[执行任务] --&gt; HASH[计算输入哈希]\n    HASH --&gt; CHECK{缓存中存在&lt;br/&gt;匹配的哈希？}\n    CHECK --&gt;|命中| RESTORE[恢复缓存的输出]\n    CHECK --&gt;|未命中| EXECUTE[执行任务]\n    EXECUTE --&gt; STORE[将输出存入缓存]\n    RESTORE --&gt; DONE[任务完成 ⚡]\n    STORE --&gt; DONE</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"本地缓存\">本地缓存</h2><p><strong>本地缓存</strong>（Local Cache）存储在开发者的机器上，默认位于项目的 <code>node_modules/.cache/turbo</code>（Turborepo）或 <code>.nx/cache</code>（Nx）目录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;, &quot;package.json&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当你执行 <code>turbo run build</code> 后再次执行相同命令，Turborepo 会检测到所有输入文件未变化，直接从缓存恢复输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"$ turbo run build&#10;&#10; Tasks:    5 successful, 5 total&#10; Cached:   4 cached, 5 total&#10; Time:     1.2s &gt;&gt;&gt; FULL TURBO\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$ turbo run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Tasks:    5 successful, 5 total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Cached:   4 cached, 5 total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Time:     1.2s >>> FULL TURBO</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 看到 <code>FULL TURBO</code> 意味着所有任务都命中了缓存。这是 Monorepo 开发体验的巅峰时刻。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"远程缓存\">远程缓存</h2><p><strong>远程缓存</strong>（Remote Cache）将构建产物存储在云端，让团队所有成员和 CI 环境共享缓存。当同事已经构建过某个包，你在本地执行时可以直接下载他的构建结果，无需重新构建。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev_A as 开发者 A&#10;    participant Cloud as 远程缓存&#10;    participant Dev_B as 开发者 B&#10;    participant CI as CI 服务器&#10;&#10;    Dev_A-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 上传 build 缓存 (hash: abc123)&#10;    Dev_B-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 请求 hash abc123&#10;    Cloud-&gt;&gt;Dev_B: 返回缓存产物 ⚡&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 请求 hash abc123&#10;    Cloud-&gt;&gt;CI: 返回缓存产物 ⚡\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev_A as 开发者 A\n    participant Cloud as 远程缓存\n    participant Dev_B as 开发者 B\n    participant CI as CI 服务器\n\n    Dev_A-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 上传 build 缓存 (hash: abc123)\n    Dev_B-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 请求 hash abc123\n    Cloud-&gt;&gt;Dev_B: 返回缓存产物 ⚡\n    CI-&gt;&gt;Cloud: 请求 hash abc123\n    Cloud-&gt;&gt;CI: 返回缓存产物 ⚡</pre><h3 id=\"turborepo-远程缓存配置\">Turborepo 远程缓存配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;remoteCache&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;signature&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"remoteCache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"signature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 使用 Vercel Remote Cache&#10;// npx turbo login&#10;// npx turbo link&#10;&#10;// 或自托管远程缓存&#10;// 设置环境变量&#10;// TURBO_API=https://cache.mycompany.com&#10;// TURBO_TOKEN=your-auth-token&#10;// TURBO_TEAM=my-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 Vercel Remote Cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx turbo login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx turbo link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或自托管远程缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置环境变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TURBO_API=https://cache.mycompany.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TURBO_TOKEN=your-auth-token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TURBO_TEAM=my-team</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-cloud-远程缓存\">Nx Cloud 远程缓存</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// nx.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;nxCloudAccessToken&quot;: &quot;your-nx-cloud-token&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasksRunnerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;default&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;runner&quot;: &quot;nx-cloud&quot;,&#10;      &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;cacheableOperations&quot;: [&quot;build&quot;, &quot;test&quot;, &quot;lint&quot;]&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// nx.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"nxCloudAccessToken\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"your-nx-cloud-token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"tasksRunnerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"runner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nx-cloud\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"cacheableOperations\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"哈希输入机制\">哈希输入机制</h2><p>缓存的正确性取决于<strong>哈希输入</strong>（Hash Inputs）的精确定义。哈希输入包括所有可能影响任务输出的因素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源代码文件</td>\n<td>包的源代码</td>\n<td><code>src/**/*.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置文件</td>\n<td>构建相关配置</td>\n<td><code>tsconfig.json</code>, <code>vite.config.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖版本</td>\n<td><code>package.json</code> 中的依赖</td>\n<td>lockfile 内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境变量</td>\n<td>影响构建的环境变量</td>\n<td><code>NODE_ENV</code>, <code>API_URL</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游产物</td>\n<td>依赖包的构建输出</td>\n<td><code>^build</code> 的输出哈希</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;],&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;, &quot;!src/**/*.test.ts&quot;, &quot;$NODE_ENV&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;globalDependencies&quot;: [&quot;tsconfig.base.json&quot;, &quot;.env&quot;],&#10;  &quot;globalEnv&quot;: [&quot;CI&quot;, &quot;NODE_ENV&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"!src/**/*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$NODE_ENV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"globalDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsconfig.base.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"globalEnv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NODE_ENV\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>!</code> 前缀排除测试文件等不影响构建输出的文件，可以减少不必要的缓存失效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存命中率优化\">缓存命中率优化</h2><p><strong>缓存命中率</strong>（Cache Hit Rate）是衡量缓存效果的核心指标。以下策略可以显著提升命中率：</p>\n<h3 id=\"精确定义-inputs\">精确定义 inputs</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;src/**/*.ts&quot;,&#10;        &quot;src/**/*.tsx&quot;,&#10;        &quot;tsconfig.json&quot;,&#10;        &quot;package.json&quot;,&#10;        &quot;!src/**/*.test.ts&quot;,&#10;        &quot;!src/**/*.spec.ts&quot;,&#10;        &quot;!src/**/__tests__/**&quot;&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;inputs&quot;: [&quot;src/**&quot;, &quot;tests/**&quot;, &quot;vitest.config.ts&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"src/**/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"src/**/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"tsconfig.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"!src/**/*.test.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"!src/**/*.spec.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"!src/**/__tests__/**\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tests/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vitest.config.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分离关注点\">分离关注点</h3><p>将不同类型的任务拆分，避免一个任务的输入变化导致另一个不相关任务的缓存失效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: []&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"避免缓存失效的常见陷阱\">避免缓存失效的常见陷阱</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间戳写入产物</td>\n<td>每次构建产物不同</td>\n<td>移除构建时的时间戳注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非确定性输出</td>\n<td>对象属性顺序不固定</td>\n<td>使用确定性的序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未固定的环境变量</td>\n<td>每次 CI 运行值不同</td>\n<td>只将必要的环境变量加入哈希</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过于宽泛的 inputs</td>\n<td><code>**/*</code> 包含了无关文件</td>\n<td>精确指定源文件模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存的安全性\">缓存的安全性</h2><p>远程缓存涉及构建产物的传输和存储，安全性不可忽视：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;remoteCache&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;signature&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"remoteCache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"signature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 缓存签名验证确保产物未被篡改&#10;// TURBO_REMOTE_CACHE_SIGNATURE_KEY=your-secret-key&#10;&#10;interface CacheEntry {&#10;  hash: string;&#10;  outputs: string[];&#10;  signature: string;&#10;  createdAt: number;&#10;  duration: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缓存签名验证确保产物未被篡改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TURBO_REMOTE_CACHE_SIGNATURE_KEY=your-secret-key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  signature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((缓存策略))&#10;    本地缓存&#10;      开发者机器&#10;      即时复用&#10;      FULL TURBO&#10;    远程缓存&#10;      团队共享&#10;      CI 共享&#10;      Vercel / Nx Cloud&#10;    哈希输入&#10;      源代码&#10;      配置文件&#10;      环境变量&#10;      依赖版本&#10;    命中率优化&#10;      精确 inputs&#10;      排除测试文件&#10;      分离关注点\">mindmap\n  root((缓存策略))\n    本地缓存\n      开发者机器\n      即时复用\n      FULL TURBO\n    远程缓存\n      团队共享\n      CI 共享\n      Vercel / Nx Cloud\n    哈希输入\n      源代码\n      配置文件\n      环境变量\n      依赖版本\n    命中率优化\n      精确 inputs\n      排除测试文件\n      分离关注点</pre><ul>\n<li>构建缓存是 Monorepo 性能优化的基石，通过输入哈希匹配实现任务输出的复用</li>\n<li>本地缓存让同一台机器上的重复构建瞬间完成，远程缓存让团队和 CI 共享构建结果</li>\n<li>哈希输入的精确定义决定了缓存的正确性和命中率</li>\n<li>排除测试文件、分离任务类型、避免非确定性输出是提升缓存命中率的关键策略</li>\n<li>远程缓存应启用签名验证，确保构建产物的完整性和安全性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存策略","id":"缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存是 Monorepo 的性能基石","id":"缓存是-monorepo-的性能基石"},{"level":2,"text":"本地缓存","id":"本地缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"远程缓存","id":"远程缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"Turborepo 远程缓存配置","id":"turborepo-远程缓存配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Nx Cloud 远程缓存","id":"nx-cloud-远程缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希输入机制","id":"哈希输入机制"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存命中率优化","id":"缓存命中率优化"},{"level":3,"text":"精确定义 inputs","id":"精确定义-inputs"},{"level":3,"text":"分离关注点","id":"分离关注点"},{"level":3,"text":"避免缓存失效的常见陷阱","id":"避免缓存失效的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存的安全性","id":"缓存的安全性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/task-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/build-and-task/incremental-builds"}}